          "type": "text",
          "text": "For small businesses seeking affordable AI SEO services that track ChatGPT and AI Overviews visibility, several strong contenders offer a range of features and pricing. These services, often referred to as Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) or Answer Engine Optimization (AEO), focus on getting your brand cited and recommended in AI-generated answers, rather than just ranking in traditional search results.\n\nHere are some of the best affordable options:\n\n**Dedicated AI Visibility Tracking Tools:**\n\n*   **Otterly.AI:** This is often cited as one of the most accessible AI visibility monitoring tools for small businesses.\n    *   **Pricing:** Plans start at $29/month for their Lite plan (15 search prompts across four engines: ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Perplexity, and Microsoft Copilot). Standard and Premium plans offer more prompts and include tracking for Gemini and Google AI Mode as paid add-ons.\n    *   **Focus:** Monitoring brand visibility, domain rankings, link citations, and AI search presence.\n*   **Ayzeo:** Offers good overall value, with plans starting at $39/month.\n    *   **Pricing:** The Starter plan is $39/month for 20 prompts, and the Pro plan is $149/month for 40 prompts, including white-label reports and Google Analytics integration.\n    *   **Focus:** Tracks visibility across seven engines: ChatGPT, Google AI Overviews, Claude, Perplexity, Gemini, DeepSeek, and Grok, with ChatGPT and Google AI Overviews included in every plan. It also includes brand sentiment analysis.\n*   **Siftly:** Another affordable entry point for tracking how AI engines mention your brand.\n\n**All-in-One SEO Suites with AI Visibility Features:**\n\n*   **SE Ranking:** A good option for teams that already use traditional SEO tools and want to add AI search monitoring.\n    *   **Features:** Offers AI search visibility features for monitoring AI Overviews, ChatGPT, and Perplexity, depending on the plan and add-ons.\n*   **Semrush:** A comprehensive traditional SEO platform that offers an AI Visibility toolkit.\n    *   **Pricing:** The AI visibility add-on starts at $99 per month per domain.\n    *   **Features:** Tracks brand mentions and share of voice across ChatGPT, AI Overviews, Perplexity, and Copilot, with add-ons for Claude, Google AI Mode, and Gemini. It also includes AI keyword research, citation analysis, and GEO audits.\n*   **Frase:** Folds AI visibility into existing SEO tools, making it suitable if you prefer not to add another subscription.\n*   **Indexly:** An affordable all-in-one tool that automates technical SEO tasks and provides advanced tracking for the AI search landscape.\n    *   **Pricing:** Paid plans start at $14 per month for the Solo plan.\n\n**Agencies Offering Affordable AI SEO Services:**\n\n*   **Thrive Internet Marketing Agency:** Offers fully managed Generative Engine Optimization (GEO) services with affordable and flexible pricing options. They have reported significant increases in traffic from AI platforms like Gemini and ChatGPT.\n*   **OutreachBloom:** Specializes in pairing AI SEO with cold email outreach, with AI SEO services starting at $3,000 per month. While this might be a higher price point, it's geared towards small to mid-market B2B companies.\n*   **Blueprint Digital:** Provides AI SEO services for small businesses to help them appear where customers are searching, including local voice and map results.\n\nWhen choosing a service, consider whether you need a dedicated AI visibility tracking tool or an all-in-one SEO suite that incorporates AI features. It's also important to identify which AI platforms your target audience uses most to ensure the service tracks those specific engines.",
